LID - 10.1510/mmcts.2016.009 [doi]
AB  - We propose the use of a new endoscopic drill for management of web-like tracheal 
      stenosis. Our device allows creating radial holes within stenosis that 
      facilitates the use of the scissors for cutting the  scar and the subsequent 
      mechanical dilatation.
