TI  - Misdirected minitracheostomy tube.
PG  - 100-101
LID - 10.4103/0971-9784.197845 [doi]
AB  - We report a patient who after an uneventful coronary artery bypass graft surgery 
      and left ventricular aneurysmorrhaphy developed intracerebral hemorrhage and 
      subsequently required minitracheostomy. Chest X-ray showed misdirected 
      minitracheostomy tube facing upward toward the laryngeal opening which was 
      repositioned using bronchoscope.
