COIS- ETHICS APPROVAL AND CONSENT TO PARTICIPATE: Ethics approval was obtained prior to 
      the initiation of the studies described in this report. To characterize the 
      analytical performance of the assay, we used total RNA samples (blinded to 
      Protected Health Information) that were derived from transbronchial biopsy (TBB) 
      and other lung tissue specimens. All lung tissue specimens including TBB were 
      collected with central (Western IRB,# 20130158, # 20141155, and #20130705) and/or 
      institutional review board approval and written informed consent from all 
      participants. Additionally, we have obtained ethics approval from the Liberty IRB 
      and written informed consent from all participants for the use of the freshly 
      collected blood samples. CONSENT FOR PUBLICATION: Not applicable. COMPETING 
