TI  - Rare manifestation of Neurofibromatosis type 1: A plexiform neurofibroma 
      involving the mediastinum and lungs with endobronchial neurofibromata.
PG  - 76-78
LID - 10.1111/1754-9485.12802 [doi]
AB  - Neurofibromatosis type 1 (NF1) is a multisystem phakomatosis. The intrathoracic 
      manifestations of NF1 are protean. We describe a rare case of a plexiform 
      neurofibroma infiltrating the mediastinum and lungs with multiple endobronchial 
      neurofibromata. To our knowledge, a mediastinal plexiform neurofibroma extending 
      into the lungs on CT has not been reported.
