TI  - Probe-based Confocal Laser Endomicroscopy in Metastatic Pulmonary Calcification.
PG  - 60-62
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0000000000000412 [doi]
AB  - We report a case of metastatic pulmonary calcification in a patient with chronic 
      renal failure on hemodialysis and secondary hyperparathyroidism. The diagnosis 
      was made by using a probe-based confocal endomicroscopy which showed specific 
      structures in the lung tissue and was proven by a transbronchial lung biopsy. To 
      the best of our knowledge, this is the first reported case of the confocal 
      endomicroscopy findings in a patient with metastatic pulmonary calcification.
