AB  - The clinical observation of the successful treatment of newly diagnosed 
      fibro-cavernous pulmonary tuberculosis caused by mycobacteria of 
      multidrug-resistant tuberculosis and the results of control of the effectiveness 
      of treatment with modern high-tech radiation methods are presented. The necessity 
      of an individual approach to the treatment of tuberculosis in this category of 
      patients is shown.
