TI  - Foreign body removal is getting "cooler".
PG  - 886-8
LID - 10.1002/ppul.23521 [doi]
AB  - Foreign body removal is commonly performed with the rigid bronchoscope. However, 
      based on recent literature, extraction with the flexible bronchoscope has 
      increased in popularity. Here, we discuss a new tool - the flexible cryoprobe - 
      that may enhance foreign body retrieval in select patients and comment on the 
      methods of foreign body extraction in the view of common clinical practice. 
      Pediatr Pulmonol. 2016; 51:886-888. © 2016 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.
