AB  - Less invasive bronchoscopic techniques for lung-volume-reduction have almost 
      replaced surgical resections. Tracheobronchial obstructions and - to a certain 
      degree - even bronchial tumors can be treated bronchoscopically. However all 
      these procedures show specific risks anesthesiologists have to consider.
