TI  - Temporary Treatment of Complex Subglottic Stenosis by an On-Site Customized 
      Stent.
PG  - 319-322
LID - S1043-0679(18)30381-2 [pii]
LID - 10.1053/j.semtcvs.2019.01.007 [doi]
AB  - Subglottic stenosis may be complex in shape, making challenging its treatment 
      with standard commercially available stents. Personalized stents can lead to 
      successful treatment; however they are not readily available due to the 
      customization waiting time. We report the use of on-site customized temporary 
      silicone stents for difficult benign subglottic stenosis in five patients unfit 
      for surgery.
