TI  - Airway Autoimmune Inflammatory Response (AAIR) Syndrome: An Asthma-Autoimmune 
      Overlap Disorder?
LID - e20170138 [pii]
LID - 10.1542/peds.2017-0138 [doi]
AB  - Asthma encompasses numerous phenotypes that may require alternate approaches to 
      diagnosis and therapy, particularly for patients whose symptoms remain poorly 
      controlled despite escalating treatment. We describe 3 patients with apparent 
      asthma who demonstrated unusual findings on cryobiopsy by flexible bronchoscopy 
      and responded to therapy directed against autoimmune disease.
