TI  - Inhalation Injury: State of the Science 2016.
PG  - 137-141
LID - 10.1097/BCR.0000000000000539 [doi]
AB  - This article summarizes research conducted over the last decade in the field of 
      inhalation injury in thermally injured patients. This includes brief summaries of 
      the findings of the 2006 State of the Science meeting with regard to inhalation 
      injury, and of the subsequent 2007 Inhalation Injury Consensus Conference. The 
      reviewed studies are categorized in to five general areas: diagnosis and grading; 
      mechanical ventilation; systemic and inhalation therapy; mechanistic alterations; 
      and outcomes.
